    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415280/extras/dd065eb67b93477107dfae7977d09f5d.avif?t=1753371008\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415280/extras/45a069d34cfe4a7da7ac0234b431d68d.avif?t=1753371008\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a single player action adventure game that includes mythological themed character actions and role-playing,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use regular attacks and skills, spells, such as magic, celestial phenomena, and body fixing spells, to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight and defeat the enemies you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2] Gameplay Introduction [/h2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Basic operation: Use the keyboard and mouse (gamepad) to control the player's hero, embark on a game journey, and control the player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move, jump, change of perspective, attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Spell skill release: Use the keyboard (gamepad) to specify keys to release skills and spells, such as clone summoning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clone attacks on enemies, use body fixing techniques to control enemy behavior, and use the magic of celestial phenomena and earth skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to increase the player's character's attack by doubling their own size Power effect, instant movement skill to evade enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Upgrade System: Eliminate a specified number of enemies, which can increase the player's hero level, health, attack power, and spells</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Enemy AI: Intelligent enemy AI enables enemies to have intelligent jumping, healing, and other AI functions, providing a superior gaming </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2] Excellent graphics [/2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed using UE5, making the characters and game scenes incredibly realistic, achieving advanced game graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2] Hero Skills [/2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different spell skills to match game characters and achieve different gaming experiences.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415280/extras/dd065eb67b93477107dfae7977d09f5d.avif?t=1753371008\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415280/extras/45a069d34cfe4a7da7ac0234b431d68d.avif?t=1753371008\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a single player action adventure game that includes mythological themed character actions and role-playing,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use regular attacks and skills, spells, such as magic, celestial phenomena, and body fixing spells, to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight and defeat the enemies you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2] Gameplay Introduction [/h2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Basic operation: Use the keyboard and mouse (gamepad) to control the player's hero, embark on a game journey, and control the player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move, jump, change of perspective, attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Spell skill release: Use the keyboard (gamepad) to specify keys to release skills and spells, such as clone summoning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clone attacks on enemies, use body fixing techniques to control enemy behavior, and use the magic of celestial phenomena and earth skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to increase the player's character's attack by doubling their own size Power effect, instant movement skill to evade enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Upgrade System: Eliminate a specified number of enemies, which can increase the player's hero level, health, attack power, and spells</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Enemy AI: Intelligent enemy AI enables enemies to have intelligent jumping, healing, and other AI functions, providing a superior gaming </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2] Excellent graphics [/2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed using UE5, making the characters and game scenes incredibly realistic, achieving advanced game graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2] Hero Skills [/2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different spell skills to match game characters and achieve different gaming experiences.</p>",
    "short_description": "This is a single player action adventure game that includes mythological themed character actions and role-playing, You can use regular attacks and skills, spells, such as magic, celestial phenomena, and body fixing spells, to Fight and defeat the enemies you encounter.",
